    "Web UI for browsing, searching, editing, memory and retrieval statistics, and configuration.",
    "SOURCE installation for Python 3.10+ and a Linux AMD64 Docker image.",
    "Default local CPU embedding with BGE-M3; the Docker image includes the complete model and requires no separate embedding service.",
    "Version checks with update guidance for SOURCE and Docker installations; upgrades remain manual."
